0 Colosseum-Style Arena
0 Name: colosseum_arena.ldr
0 Author: LEGO Designer
0 Closed ring wall, outer footprint 20 x 16 studs (400 x 320 LDU)
0 Lower tier: 2-stud-thick wall with 1x4 arched openings all around
0 Upper tier: set back 1 stud, 1-stud-thick wall with small 1x3 arches
0 Tan bricks / dark tan plate courses. Arena floor left open. Height 144 LDU.
0 Layer tops: plates -8, bricks -32, -56, arches -80, plates -88,
0             bricks -112, arches -136, coping plates -144
